      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;i-once-worried-5-th-sept-2003-orva-schrock&#34;&gt;I Once Worried (5 th Sept 2003) Orva Schrock&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/worried_schrock.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Orva Schrock&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1598003747/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/grandpa_schrock.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/grandpa_schrock.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following is an extract from Orva&amp;rsquo;s book &amp;ldquo;Grandpa&amp;rsquo;s Notebooks: The Evolution of an Amish Soul&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1598003747/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Amazon.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/1598003747/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;Amazon.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When I was a little kid I worried about if I would grow tall, have a happy home, be independent, find an appropriate career, have my own family, find out what truth is and on and on I worried.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
